<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>DrowsyCraft</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css?1.0.2">
    </head>
    <body>
        <%- include('../partials/header') %>
        <main>
            <section class="gamemodes">
                <div>
                    <img src="images/Enchanted_Stone_Sword.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1>Gamemodes</h1>
                    <p>
                        DrowsyCraft currently offers a full survival multiplayer <br> experience with tons 
                        of features to ensure an <br>enjoyable experience! We are working on introducing <br>
                        a fully custom Factions experience in the near future.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="version-support">
                <div>
                    <h1>Version Support</h1>
                    <p>
                        DrowsyCraft always try's too supports the latest <br> version of Minecraft. 
                        All versions of Java and Bedrock <br> are supported!
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img src="images/redstoneTorch.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="staff-applications">
                <div>
                    <img src="images/360.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1>Staff Applications</h1>
                    <p>
                        We're always looking for staff to bring onto the team! <br>Interested 
                        in helping out and becoming a part of the <br> DrowsyCraft project? 
                        Visit us on Discord for your next <br> steps!
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="team">
                <h1>Meet The Team</h1>
                <div>
                    <img src="images/mcpfp_-_MONKEYBOYM17_1.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                    <h2>MonkeyboyM17</h2>
                    <h3>Manager</h3>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img src="images/mcpfp_-_AMRSMOOTHIE_2.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                    <h2>AMrSmoothie</h2>
                    <h3>Director</h3>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <img src="images/mcpfp_-_will_aetos.png" alt="DrowsyCraft section image">
                    <h2>Will_Aetos</h2>
                    <h3>Manager</h3>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
        <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
    </body>
</html>